    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful two-bedroom ground floor apartment with sunny south facing patio area to the market in Millrace Drive, Saggart, Co Dublin. This stunning property is situated in a prime location within walking distance of Rathcoole and Saggart Villages with their array of amenities. Avoca, local primary and secondary schools, The Luas and Rathcoole Park with its beautiful scenery and walking trails are but a few of the many attractions to this excellent location. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most stylish internal living accommodation of C. 63 sqm briefly comprises of entrance hallway, large open plan living/dining area, beautiful fully fitted kitchen, internal hallway with hot press/storage room, two double bedrooms and main family bathroom. Located off one of the bedrooms is a door to a private patio area with a sunny south facing orientation making it the perfect little sun trap & perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. The front offers ample parking. \r\n\r\nNo. 7 Millrace Drive is presented in fantastic condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years and we see this one being extremely popular among a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area. It boasts gas fired central heating, double glazed windows and top-quality fixtures & fittings to name but a few. \r\n\r\nDo not miss this one; call Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional features; \r\n•BER B \r\n•c. 63 sqm \r\n•MGMT fee c. 1,396 per annum \r\n•2 bed / 1 bath \r\n•Ground floor apartment \r\n•Own door apartment \r\n•Gas fired central heating \r\n•Double glazed windows\r\n•Top quality blinds \r\n•Fantastic condition throughout\r\n•Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n•Entrance hallway \r\n•Large open plan living/dining area \r\n•Beautiful fully fitted kitchen\r\n•Internal hallway with storage \r\n•Two spacious bedrooms \r\n•Built in wardrobes \r\n•Main family bathroom \r\n•Sunny south facing patio area \r\n•Private and not shared \r\n•Ample communal parking to the front of the property\r\n•Exclusive development \r\n•Highly sought-after area\r\n•Bus routes on your doorstep \r\n•Within easy reach of Rathcoole and Saggart Village \r\n•Within easy reach of The M50 Motorway & The Luas \r\n•Ideal for 1st time buyers & investors \r\n\r\nDirections\r\nFrom Red Cow, proceed along Naas Road. Continue through the lights at Newlands Cross and then take the 4th exit for Rathcoole / Saggart. At the roundabout turn left and follow the road ahead. At the next roundabout then take your second exit into the Millrace development. Within the development turn right onto Millrace Drive where number 7 will be on the left."
      },
